# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# EF AI Workspace — .gitignore
# Policy: secrets, runtime data, and real documents NEVER enter Git.
# See SECURITY.md and docs/security/data-handling.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# Secrets & environment files (templates ending in .example are allowed)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.*.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*.jks
**/secrets/*
!**/secrets/README.md

# LibreChat / service runtime data (persisted in Docker volumes, never in Git).
# Anchored to the repo root and infrastructure/ so planned folders such as assets/brand/images/,
# tests/fixtures/ and ai/knowledge/synthetic/ are NOT ignored.
/data/
/data-node/
/meili_data*/
/uploads/
/images/
/logs/
/infrastructure/**/data/
/infrastructure/**/data-node/
/infrastructure/**/meili_data*/
/infrastructure/**/uploads/
/infrastructure/**/images/
/infrastructure/**/logs/
# On-premises TLS certificate/key directory (enterprise CA material, never in Git)
/infrastructure/**/tls/
mongo_data*/
pgdata*/
*.log

# Backups and database dumps
/backups/
/infrastructure/**/backups/
*.dump
*.bson
*.archive
*.sql.gz
*.tar.gz

# Real (non-synthetic) knowledge documents must never be committed
ai/knowledge/**/private/
ai/knowledge/**/confidential/

# Claude Code local-only settings and memory
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md

# Tooling caches
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
node_modules/
.cache/
.pytest_cache/

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp
